    Justification: Upon reviewing ShortLongSpell.openPosition, _deposit, 
closePosition, and _withdraw, I confirmed that the boundary does not 
independently enforce a meaningful minimum output or freshness constraint. 
openPosition validates only that swapData.fromToken matches the borrow token and
